(7639422, 1240024, 103142, '<td valign="top">I would love to see this in a portrait crop. The center is just magnificent, but there''s just too much on the sides that distract from it. <br/> <br/>Or perhaps lighter in the center and a graduated neutral density coming in from each of the sides?<br/> <br/>Normally I assume that people have things just the way they want it. But this one just feels like it could be a stunning 10. But it''s just feeling like a 7 now. Tantalizingly close to truly incredible.</td>', 'I would love to see this in a portrait crop. The center is just magnificent, but there''s just too much on the sides that distract from it.  Or perhaps lighter in the center and a graduated neutral density coming in from each of the sides? Normally I assume that people have things just the way they want it. But this one just feels like it could be a stunning 10. But it''s just feeling like a 7 now. Tantalizingly close to truly incredible.', '2019-08-25 17:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
