(7639483, 1240029, 135744, '<td valign="top">Piles of peat in a field in Connemara, Ireland.<br/>Peat is a brown deposit resembling soil, formed by the partial decomposition of vegetable matter in the wet acidic conditions of bogs and fens, and often cut out and dried for use as fuel and in gardening.</td>', 'Piles of peat in a field in Connemara, Ireland.Peat is a brown deposit resembling soil, formed by the partial decomposition of vegetable matter in the wet acidic conditions of bogs and fens, and often cut out and dried for use as fuel and in gardening.', '2019-08-26 03:23:55.000000', NULL, 0),
