(7639524, 1239730, 86447, '<td valign="top">Who knows why voters vote what they do, Margaret?<br/> <br/>I always get it wrong.   They sometimes love the ones I just stick in and think will sink... then they hate the ones I love.<br/> <br/>Anyway, to answer your question, this is a six vote in my book.   I think it''s a good shot, but not really spectacular.  I enjoy looking at it but I don''t say "wow!".   (am I being too honest??)   I think it would have had more "pop!" if the water had more motion blur and the rocks and trees were in sharper focus.   As I follow the water from the top... it''s flowing... flowing... and then BAM!  It stops into nothing.   It kinda makes me uncomfortable... a bit.   I want to see what it''s flowing into.<br/> <br/>I also hiked a bit to get my shot... and couldn''t get what I wanted out of it.   Darnsies.<br/> <br/>Let''s both try again.  :D<br/> <br/></td>', 'Who knows why voters vote what they do, Margaret? I always get it wrong.   They sometimes love the ones I just stick in and think will sink... then they hate the ones I love. Anyway, to answer your question, this is a six vote in my book.   I think it''s a good shot, but not really spectacular.  I enjoy looking at it but I don''t say "wow!".   (am I being too honest??)   I think it would have had more "pop!" if the water had more motion blur and the rocks and trees were in sharper focus.   As I follow the water from the top... it''s flowing... flowing... and then BAM!  It stops into nothing.   It kinda makes me uncomfortable... a bit.   I want to see what it''s flowing into. I also hiked a bit to get my shot... and couldn''t get what I wanted out of it.   Darnsies. Let''s both try again.  :D ', '2019-08-26 14:14:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(7639525, 1239971, 86447, '<td valign="top">This is lovely, Larry!<br/> <br/>I think it would have scored better without the fountain giving it a man-made impression when... without it, we think it''s far away with only the egret in nature.<br/> <br/>Or, maybe I''m nuts.<br/> <br/>That must be it.  I''ve been told...  :D<br/> <br/></td>', 'This is lovely, Larry! I think it would have scored better without the fountain giving it a man-made impression when... without it, we think it''s far away with only the egret in nature. Or, maybe I''m nuts. That must be it.  I''ve been told...  :D ', '2019-08-26 14:16:16.000000', NULL, 0),
